{"seq":4,"slug":"gui-and-tools","title":"GUI 与工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/ecosystem/gui-and-tools","wordCount":717,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"gui-与工具\">GUI 与工具</h1><h2 id=\"终端-ui-工具\">终端 UI 工具</h2><p>对于习惯命令行的开发者，<strong>终端 UI（TUI）工具</strong>提供了介于纯命令行和图形界面之间的高效交互体验。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Git 工具生态覆盖从终端界面到输出美化的多个环节，可按职责划分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TUI</td>\n<td>终端内的全屏交互界面（lazygit、tig、gitui）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pager</td>\n<td>分页与美化 diff 输出（delta）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>difftool</td>\n<td>用外部工具查看差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mergetool</td>\n<td>用外部工具解决冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>alias</td>\n<td>自定义命令别名，缩短常用操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLI 增强</td>\n<td>扩展 Git 能力的命令行工具（gh、git-absorb）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"lazygit\">Lazygit</h2><p><strong>lazygit</strong> 是最流行的 Git TUI 工具，提供直观的面板式界面和丰富的键盘快捷键：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"brew install lazygit&#10;&#10;lazygit\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lazygit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lazygit</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>面板</th>\n<th>快捷键</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Status</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>仓库状态概览</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Files</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>文件暂存/取消暂存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Branches</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>分支管理、切换、合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Commits</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>提交历史、交互式变基</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stash</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>stash 管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# lazygit 常用操作&#10;# space  - 暂存/取消暂存文件&#10;# c      - 提交&#10;# P      - 推送&#10;# p      - 拉取&#10;# r      - 在 commits 面板中进入交互式变基&#10;# s      - squash 提交&#10;# f      - fixup 提交&#10;# d      - 在 files 面板中查看 diff\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># lazygit 常用操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># space  - 暂存/取消暂存文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># c      - 提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># P      - 推送</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># p      - 拉取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># r      - 在 commits 面板中进入交互式变基</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># s      - squash 提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># f      - fixup 提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># d      - 在 files 面板中查看 diff</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[lazygit] --&gt; B[Files 面板]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Branches 面板]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Commits 面板]&#10;    A --&gt; E[Stash 面板]&#10;    B --&gt; F[暂存 / diff]&#10;    C --&gt; G[切换 / 合并]&#10;    D --&gt; H[变基 / cherry-pick]&#10;    E --&gt; I[保存 / 恢复]\">graph LR\n    A[lazygit] --&gt; B[Files 面板]\n    A --&gt; C[Branches 面板]\n    A --&gt; D[Commits 面板]\n    A --&gt; E[Stash 面板]\n    B --&gt; F[暂存 / diff]\n    C --&gt; G[切换 / 合并]\n    D --&gt; H[变基 / cherry-pick]\n    E --&gt; I[保存 / 恢复]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> lazygit 的交互式变基体验远优于命令行——直接在 commit 列表上按 <code>s</code>（squash）、<code>f</code>（fixup）、<code>d</code>（drop）即可操作。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tig\">Tig</h2><p><strong>tig</strong> 是基于 ncurses 的 Git 仓库浏览器，专注于历史浏览和代码审查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"brew install tig&#10;&#10;tig&#10;tig blame src/config.sh&#10;tig log --all&#10;tig stash\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tig</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> blame</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tig</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --all</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tig</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stash</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>视图</th>\n<th>快捷键</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Main</td>\n<td>m</td>\n<td>提交历史（图形）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Diff</td>\n<td>d</td>\n<td>查看提交差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Log</td>\n<td>l</td>\n<td>详细日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blame</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>逐行追溯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tree</td>\n<td>t</td>\n<td>文件树浏览</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stash</td>\n<td>y</td>\n<td>stash 列表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"gitui\">GitUI</h2><p><strong>gitui</strong> 使用 Rust 编写，以高性能著称，启动速度和大仓库操作速度优于 lazygit：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"brew install gitui&#10;&#10;gitui\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gitui</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gitui</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>lazygit</th>\n<th>tig</th>\n<th>gitui</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语言</td>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能丰富度</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>中等（浏览）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交互式变基</td>\n<td>✅ 优秀</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>启动速度</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大仓库性能</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>最好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"difftool-配置\">Difftool 配置</h2><p><strong>Difftool</strong> 使用外部工具查看文件差异：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git config --global diff.tool vscode&#10;git config --global difftool.vscode.cmd &#39;code --wait --diff $LOCAL $REMOTE&#39;&#10;git config --global difftool.prompt false&#10;&#10;git difftool HEAD~1&#10;git difftool main..feature\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff.tool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> vscode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> difftool.vscode.cmd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'code --wait --diff $LOCAL $REMOTE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> difftool.prompt</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> difftool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD~1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> difftool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main..feature</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>配置命令</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VS Code</td>\n<td><code>code --wait --diff $LOCAL $REMOTE</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>vim</td>\n<td><code>vimdiff $LOCAL $REMOTE</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>delta</td>\n<td>作为 pager 使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>difftastic</td>\n<td>结构化差异（理解语法树）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"delta-美化输出\">Delta 美化输出</h2><p><strong>delta</strong> 是一个 Git diff 输出美化工具，提供语法高亮和 side-by-side 视图：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"brew install git-delta&#10;&#10;git config --global core.pager delta&#10;git config --global interactive.diffFilter &#39;delta --color-only&#39;&#10;git config --global delta.navigate true&#10;git config --global delta.side-by-side true&#10;git config --global delta.line-numbers true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git-delta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> core.pager</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> delta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> interactive.diffFilter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'delta --color-only'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> delta.navigate</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> delta.side-by-side</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> delta.line-numbers</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比</th>\n<th>默认 diff</th>\n<th>delta</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语法高亮</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Side-by-side</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行号</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件导航</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅（n/N 键）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"mergetool-配置\">Mergetool 配置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git config --global merge.tool vscode&#10;git config --global mergetool.vscode.cmd &#39;code --wait --merge $REMOTE $LOCAL $BASE $MERGED&#39;&#10;git config --global mergetool.keepBackup false&#10;&#10;git mergetool\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge.tool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> vscode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mergetool.vscode.cmd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'code --wait --merge $REMOTE $LOCAL $BASE $MERGED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mergetool.keepBackup</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mergetool</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"git-aliases\">Git Aliases</h2><p>自定义别名提升效率：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git config --global alias.co checkout&#10;git config --global alias.br branch&#10;git config --global alias.ci commit&#10;git config --global alias.st status&#10;git config --global alias.lg &quot;log --oneline --graph --all --decorate&quot;&#10;git config --global alias.unstage &quot;reset HEAD --&quot;&#10;git config --global alias.last &quot;log -1 HEAD&quot;&#10;git config --global alias.wip &quot;commit -am &#39;WIP&#39;&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alias.co</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alias.br</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> branch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alias.ci</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alias.st</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alias.lg</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"log --oneline --graph --all --decorate\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alias.unstage</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"reset HEAD --\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alias.last</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"log -1 HEAD\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alias.wip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"commit -am 'WIP'\"</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git lg&#10;&#10;git co feature/login&#10;git st&#10;git wip\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> co</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature/login</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> st</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> wip</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"效率工具推荐\">效率工具推荐</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>lazygit</td>\n<td>TUI</td>\n<td>全功能 Git 终端界面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tig</td>\n<td>TUI</td>\n<td>历史浏览和 blame</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gitui</td>\n<td>TUI</td>\n<td>高性能 Git 终端界面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>delta</td>\n<td>Pager</td>\n<td>diff 美化输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>difftastic</td>\n<td>Diff 工具</td>\n<td>语法感知差异比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gh CLI</td>\n<td>CLI</td>\n<td>GitHub 官方命令行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>git-absorb</td>\n<td>CLI</td>\n<td>自动生成 fixup commit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>git-branchless</td>\n<td>CLI</td>\n<td>提供类似 Mercurial 的体验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"brew install lazygit tig gitui git-delta difftastic gh\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lazygit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tig</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gitui</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git-delta</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> difftastic</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gh</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((GUI 与工具))&#10;    TUI 工具&#10;      lazygit 全功能&#10;      tig 历史浏览&#10;      gitui 高性能&#10;    Diff 美化&#10;      delta&#10;      difftastic&#10;      side-by-side&#10;    配置工具&#10;      difftool&#10;      mergetool&#10;      aliases&#10;    CLI 增强&#10;      gh CLI&#10;      git-absorb&#10;      git-branchless\">mindmap\n  root((GUI 与工具))\n    TUI 工具\n      lazygit 全功能\n      tig 历史浏览\n      gitui 高性能\n    Diff 美化\n      delta\n      difftastic\n      side-by-side\n    配置工具\n      difftool\n      mergetool\n      aliases\n    CLI 增强\n      gh CLI\n      git-absorb\n      git-branchless</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>lazygit</strong> 是功能最丰富的 Git TUI 工具，交互式变基体验尤为出色</li>\n<li><strong>tig</strong> 专注于历史浏览和 blame，轻量高效</li>\n<li><strong>gitui</strong> 使用 Rust 编写，在大仓库上性能最佳</li>\n<li><strong>delta</strong> 将 diff 输出升级为语法高亮 + side-by-side 视图，显著提升可读性</li>\n<li>善用 <strong>Git aliases</strong> 和配置 <strong>difftool/mergetool</strong> 可以大幅提升日常操作效率</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GUI 与工具","id":"gui-与工具"},{"level":2,"text":"终端 UI 工具","id":"终端-ui-工具"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Lazygit","id":"lazygit"},{"level":2,"text":"Tig","id":"tig"},{"level":2,"text":"GitUI","id":"gitui"},{"level":2,"text":"Difftool 配置","id":"difftool-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Delta 美化输出","id":"delta-美化输出"},{"level":2,"text":"Mergetool 配置","id":"mergetool-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Git Aliases","id":"git-aliases"},{"level":2,"text":"效率工具推荐","id":"效率工具推荐"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"签名与安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/ecosystem/signing-and-security"},"next":null}